        <p class="text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-[#E5DFD2] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Boutique coastal stay in the heart of the capital — minutes from Cellular Jail, Corbyn's Cove Beach &amp; island ferries.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#F3E7C4] bg-white/[0.06] border border-[#D6B66C]/30 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5">
